Subject: [PATCH] be: Arrow Flight SQL connector (FlightDataSource),
 FLIGHT_SCAN_NODE, FLIGHT_TABLE

Connector "flight" (ConnectorType FLIGHT): one FlightDataSource per TFlightScanRange (endpoint).
DoGet with bearer token or basic auth, call headers, TLS options, keepalive; failover to the next
location while nothing has been delivered and the error means unreachable; cancellation of blocked
reads through a process-wide watcher thread; Arrow -> Chunk via ParquetScanner converters; conjuncts
and LIMIT evaluated in the data source. FLIGHT_TABLE uses the plain TableDescriptor.
